### Get countries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get countries -ve test case (unsupported verb: expect HTTP 405 GenericResponse, not 500)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get country ratings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/country-ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get countries (legacy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/countries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "correlationID": "test-corr-001"
}


### Get country ratings (legacy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/countryRatings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

